        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methyl ester, from biogenic oils, mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methyl ester, from biogenic oils, mix, at regional storage
Inventory refers to 1 kg biodiesel used as transport fuel for blending of diesel.;
UUID: 4290d583-d2ec-3572-b130-a8708c33f8b6
This dataset includes the mix of methyl ester used as biofuels for the European supply mix.
Location: Europe
Technology: No technology modelled
Time period: Data for the supply mix in 2014.
Production volume: 2.1 Mio tonnes
Sampling: Statistical data published by the European Commission. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4290d583-d2ec-3572-b130-a8708c33f8b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
